      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, looping through a large list would be inefficient. However, the temporary fail cause list will never be a large list (this is not the purpose anyway). If the list would be large then a HashMap would be the preferred solution, but as long as the list is short, just looping through it is a more light weight solution.",
